:buClr><a:schemeClr val="dk1"/></a:buClr><a:buSzPts val="2400"/><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr b="0" i="0" lang="en-US" sz="2400" u="none"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="dk1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri"/><a:sym typeface="Calibri"/></a:rPr><a:t>Acetyl-CoA released from peroxisomal </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr b="0" i="1" lang="en-US" sz="2400" u="none"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="dk1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri"/><a:sym typeface="Calibri"/></a:rPr><a:t>β</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr b="0" i="0" lang="en-US" sz="2400" u="none"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="dk1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri"/><a:sym typeface="Calibri"/></a:rPr><a:t> oxidation can be used in glyoxylate cycle or exported to cytosol and then imported to mitochondria.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:pic><p:nvPicPr><p:cNvPr descr="A comparison of beta-oxidation in mitochondria and peroxisomes/glyoxysomes.  In this image, the left side is mitochondrion and the right side is peroxisome/glyoxysome. At the top it begins with R bonding right to CH2, which bonds right to CH2 (mitochondrion side), which bonds right to C, which double bonds up and right to O and down to S-CoA (peroxisome/glyoxysome side). An arrow points down the middle of the sides. On the left, FAD has a curved red arrow to the right pointing down to FADH2, which also has a curved red arrow to the left pointing back up to FAD. To the left of this is a respiratory chain in a red box) pointing down to ATP. To the left of this O2 has a curved arrow pointing down to H2O. On the right side of the middle arrow is FAD pointing down to FADH2 with a curved arrow on the left side, and a curved arrow on the right side pointing back up to FAD. To the right of that is H2O2 pointing down to H20 [plus] 1/2O2 with a curved pink arrow. Just above the H20 is O2, which has a curved pink arrow pointing back up to H2O2. Below the arrow in the middle is C bonding left to R, up to H, and double bonding right to C, which bonds down to H (mitochondrion side), which bonds right to C, which double bonds up and right to O and down and right to S-CoA (peroxisome/glyoxysome side). Below this is an arrow pointing down the middle. H2O points to this arrow on both sides. The arrow points to C, which bonds left to R, up to OH, down to H, and right to CH2 (mitochondrion side), which bonds right to C, which double bonds up and right to O and down and right to S-CoA (peroxisome/glyoxysome side). Below this is an arrow down the middle. To the left of the arrow is NAD+ pointing down to NADH with a pink curved arrow on the right side, which also had a pink curved arrow pointing from NADH back up to NAD+ on the left side. To the left is the respiratory chain and O2/H2) exchange described above. On the right side of the middle arrow is NAD+, which has a pink cured arrow on the left pointing down to NADH- (where the – is in pink). NADH- has a dashed pink arrow to the right pointing back up to NAD+. To the right of this, it states, “NADH exported for reoxidation.” Below the middle arrow, C bonds left to R, double bonds up to O, and right to CH2 (mitochondrion side), which bonds right to C, which double bonds up and right to O and down and right to S-CoA (peroxisome/glyoxysome side). Below this is an arrow down the middle. CoA-SH feeds into this arrow on both sides. This arrow points to R, which bonds right to C, which double bonds up and right to O and down and right to S-CoA. Below this is a plus sign. Below this, CH3 has a dashed arrow left to citric acid cycle. CH3 also bonds right to C, which double bonds up and right to O and down and right to S-CoA. To the right of this is a dashed arrow pointing right to acetyl-CoA exported." id="452" name="Google Shape;452;p62"/><p:cNvPicPr preferRelativeResize="0"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvPicPr><p:blipFill rotWithShape="1"><a:blip r:embed="rId3"><a:alphaModFix/></a:blip><a:srcRect b="0" l="0" r="0" t="0"/><a:stretch/></p:blipFill><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="4959350" y="225425"/><a:ext cx="3879850" cy="6407150"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln><a:noFill/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:pic></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>